<<<
intensive (Gram.); '* tightening up'. Said of words or word-elements that 'add emphasis; in vastly obliged, perdurable, vastly & per- are ii. Often in contrast with privative (see below); the in- of incisive (& intensive) is intensive, & that of incivility privative.
===
*intensive* (Gram.); 'tightening up'. Said of words or word-elements that add emphasis; *vastly obliged, perdurable, vastly* & *per-* are ii. Often in contrast with *privative* (see below); the in- of *incisive* (& *intensive*) is intensive, & that of *incivility* privative.
>>>

